    "detailed_description": "Bay Bell is a science fiction point and click word puzzle game. Navigate the off-course \u201cBay Bell\u201d spaceship, decipher languages, learn the unique backstories of those on board, and find a way toward returning home.<br><br>The end is near\u2026 Can you save the Bay Bell?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tSpace, time travel, humans, robots, and aliens! Meet a cast of interesting and likeable characters with their own dreams, fears, hopes, and goals aboard the spaceship.<br></li><li>\t65 challenging but accessible letter cipher puzzles. Even for players unaccustomed to deciphering, these are designed to be approachable for all ages.<br></li><li>\tA story-rich experience that unfolds from solving the game's puzzles.<br></li><li>\tArtwork in an abstract painterly style. Enjoy distinctive visuals while you play!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Bay Bell is a science fiction point and click word puzzle game. Navigate the off-course \u201cBay Bell\u201d spaceship, decipher languages, learn the unique backstories of those on board, and find a way toward returning home.<br><br>The end is near\u2026 Can you save the Bay Bell?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tSpace, time travel, humans, robots, and aliens! Meet a cast of interesting and likeable characters with their own dreams, fears, hopes, and goals aboard the spaceship.<br></li><li>\t65 challenging but accessible letter cipher puzzles. Even for players unaccustomed to deciphering, these are designed to be approachable for all ages.<br></li><li>\tA story-rich experience that unfolds from solving the game's puzzles.<br></li><li>\tArtwork in an abstract painterly style. Enjoy distinctive visuals while you play!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A science fiction point and click word puzzle video game. Navigate an off-course spaceship, and find a way toward returning home. The end is near\u2026 Can you save the Bay Bell?",
